Straw Golem Continuation

Straw Golem Continuation adapts the farming golem for Minecraft 26.1.2 on Fabric with a Java
model and Java keyframe animations. This development snapshot is dated
2026-11-24.

Straw Golem Updated by NoHero (HeroBrianMack) is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only.
The released upstream source contains the straw hat texture and the particle
files fly.png, food.png, snow.png, snowfall.png, and snowfall.png.mcmeta
included in Straw Golem Continuation.
https://github.com/HeroBrianMack/RE-Strawgolem/tree/b3961aaea843d57e89faee6f5429f585d0c2c4e6
https://modrinth.com/mod/straw-golem-rebaled-updated

The upstream project credits Fr3nderman for the original model and
CommodoreThrawn for the preliminary design. The straw hat and fly particle
textures also appear in Straw Golem Rebaled by CommodoreThrawn.
